ision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_022"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"9ebc192fbc05715cf7f717f7f5899cd368f8790a1c880b7a2bff3665ad9ac302","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_023"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_024"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_025"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_proj_002","span_proj_004","span_proj_020","span_proj_021","span_proj_022","span_proj_023","span_proj_024","span_proj_025"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":8},"heading":"研究目的和终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本章节阐述本研究的总体目的与终点体系。本研究为确证性III期临床研究，主要目的为评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效，主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答的受试者比例。次要目的为评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响，关键次要终点包括第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例和第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例，其他次要终点包括第16周PASI评分较基线的变化和第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。安全性终点包括治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率，以及实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。探索性目的和探索性终点见第3.3节。","rationale":"本章节依据已确认研究事实汇总主要、次要和安全性目的及终点；主要终点、关键次要终点、其他次要终点和安全性终点的表述均直接来自项目研究定义。医学作者需核对本章节与第3.1、3.2（若有）及第3.3节之间的一致性，并确认探索性目的和终点的最终内容。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（研究目的和终点），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_cc81ab6b8717128e","section_number":"3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:982209dab2d682567f8a2b45","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b9f50aa913504"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015234_54a1eac3","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:982209dab2d682567f8a2b45","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_db5f25e7dd5b8877\n章节编号=3.1\n章节标题=主要目的和主要终点\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。\n第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"b14ec297a71a261c9dc4c99eaae920686196988e3e396fa32348e8425dc3307f","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:982209dab2d682567f8a2b45","span_id":"span_draft_001"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要研究目的：评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。","quote_sha256":"91f9668c833c01c737e00948c18613521366f596752872eef9fc69a09e681b8f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_020"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_022"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"统计分析策略：全分析集按随机分组采用CMH方法比较主要终点，报告应答率差、95%置信区间和P值，以优效性为目标。主要缺失处理采用无应答填补，并以多重插补和观察病例分析进行敏感性分析；安全性集按实际治疗分析。不开展期中分析。","quote_sha256":"ccd7b348358b71793f3761994bf0e928e73abcd319f577b74f5285d5c99e3b7c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_030"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_draft_001","span_proj_020","span_proj_022","span_proj_030"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"heading":"主要目的和主要终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"主要目的为评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。主要终点为第16周达到PASI 75应答的受试者比例，其中PASI 75应答定义为较基线PASI评分改善≥75%。该终点在第16周双盲治疗期结束时进行评价，比较试验组与安慰剂组的应答率，以优效性为目标。","rationale":"主要目的和主要终点的表述直接来源于已确认研究事实，包括主要研究目的、主要终点定义、评价时间点和优效性目标。医学作者需核对PASI 75应答定义与统计分析计划的一致性。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（主要目的和主要终点），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_db5f25e7dd5b8877","section_number":"3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:982209dab2d682567f8a2b45","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b9f50aa913504"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015234_54a1eac3","content_status":"decision_required","decision_items":[{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_9e670d193fbbb761","fact_path":"picos.exploratory_objectives","options":[{"label":"不单独设置探索性目的","option_id":"exp_obj_none","summary":"不新增独立的探索性研究问题，相关探索性分析依托已确认的次要终点数据。"},{"label":"设置与疾病活动度动态变化相关的探索性目的","option_id":"exp_obj_disease_course","summary":"在已确认的PASI和sPGA评价基础上，探索不同时间点疾病活动度变化的特征。"},{"label":"设置与患者报告结局相关的探索性目的","option_id":"exp_obj_qol","summary":"在已确认的DLQI评价基础上，探索皮肤病相关生活质量的其他分析维度。"}],"question":"本研究的探索性目的应如何设定？","rationale":"当前项目已确认研究事实未定义探索性目的，也未提供支持性探索研究计划。保守推荐不单独设置探索性目的，避免在缺乏项目依据时引入未确认的研究假设。","recommended_option_id":"exp_obj_none"},{"blocking_section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_9e670d193fbbb761","fact_path":"picos.exploratory_endpoints","options":[{"label":"不单独设置探索性终点","option_id":"exp_end_none","summary":"不新增独立探索性终点，相关探索性分析限于已确认的次要终点数据。"},{"label":"设置与疾病活动度时序变化相关的探索性终点","option_id":"exp_end_time_course","summary":"探索PASI或sPGA在非主要时间点的变化趋势。"},{"label":"设置与生活质量维度相关的探索性终点","option_id":"exp_end_qol_dimensions","summary":"探索DLQI各维度或不同时间点的变化。"}],"question":"本研究的探索性终点应如何设定？","rationale":"当前项目已确认研究事实未定义探索性终点，也未提供量表授权、生物标志物或药代动力学等支持材料。保守推荐不单独设置探索性终点，待医学作者与统计师确认是否需要补充探索性分析。","recommended_option_id":"exp_end_none"}],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要研究目的：评价合成试验药A相较安慰剂治疗成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疗效。","quote_sha256":"91f9668c833c01c737e00948c18613521366f596752872eef9fc69a09e681b8f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_020"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"次要研究目的：评价合成试验药A对皮损清除程度及皮肤病相关生活质量的影响。","quote_sha256":"f60b7980df919c77b6b4674e5a8a1013c4753590e096ca6566a70adbd1e9b6e4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_021"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"主要终点：第16周达到PASI 75应答（较基线PASI评分改善≥75%）的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"0726a50bb0c8f1c5ec79b9e21b343bfd08fddc0a595315a5c8e3769df01ce9a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_022"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"关键次要终点：第16周sPGA达到0或1且较基线改善≥2级的受试者比例。；第16周达到PASI 90应答的受试者比例。","quote_sha256":"9ebc192fbc05715cf7f717f7f5899cd368f8790a1c880b7a2bff3665ad9ac302","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_023"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"其他次要终点：第16周PASI评分较基线的变化。；第16周DLQI评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"1f739c14310a6a5f292991854360290460a4b501e71c36ec724647d8123a4023","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_024"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"安全性终点：治疗期间出现的不良事件（TEAE）、严重不良事件及导致停药的不良事件发生率。；实验室检查、生命体征及12导联心电图具有临床意义的变化。","quote_sha256":"99133b9298d6b094501b14430ac89a3b690a9aa9acb4bb1df325ea3196a44236","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_025"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_proj_020","span_proj_021","span_proj_022","span_proj_023","span_proj_024","span_proj_025"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":6},"heading":"探索性目的和探索性终点","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"当前项目已确认研究事实未包含探索性目的和探索性终点的定义。本批次提供的待确认研究字段picos.exploratory_objectives和picos.exploratory_endpoints分别对应探索性目的和探索性终点的决策。医学作者需与统计师、临床团队共同确认后填写本章节。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_9e670d193fbbb761","section_number":"3.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:982209dab2d682567f8a2b45","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b9f50aa913504"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922015234_54a1eac3","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究分期：III期","quote_sha256":"5ac919b18530a35e6df200dbf04b4bc9fbd8d00da2c279aa58a1ff849584b451","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_002"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"开发区域：中国","quote_sha256":"cff843d358ea50e7e53ede8d1eba9b9d23baa740d2cd2134679e6483c3e50b76","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_003"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"内在研究目的：确证性研究","quote_sha256":"9910bf06ee75c8853c143b11ec7df385f95306b1d5f76e729515dd9609db0a9c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_004"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"总体研究设计：平行组（parallel assignment）、双盲、安慰剂对照、随机","quote_sha256":"671a62a354113705569b311f82cdff13e6dc35ab5faac84b8993f18ac7fe7ebc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_005"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"目标研究人群：成人中重度斑块状银屑病患者","quote_sha256":"a1f2b59730f1d08cde8f6a85d4179e62887b3729f4175c98334b9dafda33e808","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_006"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_010"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量再估计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"913a62236e4f4332a7188562f2625d53aa7f770cea155664564c5fb821a98efd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_011"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"期中分析是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"31ef70e7f5cd03d6c17b90802e7352c6e81b5fdc853989b74ea1499901f514a4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_012"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究人群概述：确诊为斑块状银屑病、疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者。","quote_sha256":"a8e79e0e0422cd44b88dc3e21e985b80d8a582156f8af354719235edcd236224","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_013"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄≥18岁；确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月；筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3；适合接受系统治疗或光疗。","quote_sha256":"3e9ca06af65f6aeb7e28df97f2a93f40d8966553fa5faff3f806e43f762999dd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_014"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"排除标准模块：非斑块型银屑病为主要表现，或存在可能干扰疗效/安全性评价的其他活动性皮肤病；活动性严重感染；妊娠或哺乳期；研究者判断不适合参加。","quote_sha256":"25de1577631d408629fd83338122249e7d0333f30cafbcf4445c1c9991fc6aee","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_015"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"试验干预：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂。","quote_sha256":"f3eff5ef57b4691ff025db695140e4ead682562786c0dec621edcd256ef28af3","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_016"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"剂量与给药方案：合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"e97da70f0c9a5d6f604a29b6c054d0ed03fc9fd60470293f55ab4afbebddcff0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_017"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"6e161fdc710a0a80dfd37e8087ba89849d7bfdb2aa6b1f8d9a2466c304e8fae9","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_018"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"对照：匹配安慰剂对照；试验组与安慰剂组按1:1随机分配，双盲治疗16周。","quote_sha256":"bcf69f1343deaa3b4cd6b8ab0fd4fbac84bf974c3118292b17999b1ba93aa172","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_019"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"研究时期：筛选期：最长4周。；双盲治疗期：16周。；安全性随访期：4周。","quote_sha256":"1df9f3c36a7060d2c1dfbc24b66dd9be14f4efacd4868bd85df3940f627371af","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_026"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_027"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"样本量策略：假设第16周PASI 75应答率试验组为60%、安慰剂组为30%，双侧α=0.05、把握度90%、1:1随机，并考虑15%脱落，共计划入组132例（每组66例）。","quote_sha256":"2088842f2548655845b43f017bb904dc2663a94d1a5c7a802e7adf8daa68b0d2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_029"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"药物技术类型：small_molecule","quote_sha256":"d8ca21a7e62cbca0e65228c7147e2ce5e59273b60f0d0cc55ed216f48e27710c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_031"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_032"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_033"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"局部/系统暴露范围：systemic","quote_sha256":"83a8469236905f60f11fec86f93234f3ddf2027482e82bafa90802a6e138e6e2","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_proj_034"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_proj_002","span_proj_003","span_proj_004","span_proj_005","span_proj_006","span_proj_010","span_proj_011","span_proj_012","span_proj_013","span_proj_014","span_proj_015","span_proj_016","span_proj_017","span_proj_018","span_proj_019","span_proj_026","span_proj_027","span_proj_029","span_proj_031","span_proj_032","span_proj_033","span_proj_034"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":22},"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为在中国开展的多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照的III期临床研究，采用平行组设计。目标人群为确诊为斑块状银屑病且疾病严重程度为中重度的成人受试者（年龄≥18岁，确诊斑块状银屑病≥6个月，筛选及基线时PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3，且适合接受系统治疗或光疗）。受试者按1:1随机分配至试验组或对照组，试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，连续16周；对照组接受匹配安慰剂，每日一次，连续16周。研究包含最长4周筛选期、16周双盲治疗期和4周安全性随访期。筛选后于基线/第1天随机，第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。计划入组132例受试者，每组66例。本研究不开展期中分析，也不计划样本量再估计。","rationale":"本章节依据已确认研究事实描述研究设计，包括研究分期、开发区域、多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组设计、1:1随机、试验干预与剂量、研究时期、访视策略和样本量。医学作者需核对研究设计描述与统计分析计划及方案其他章节的一致性。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（期中分析、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（研究设计），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_1741b1557c67abd7","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:982209dab2d682567f8a2b45","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b9f50aa913504"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:982209dab2d682567f8a2b45","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:982209dab2d682567f8a2b45","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"93840d460fbf8d92b1dbf188662859f1b30c9e2cc4ddfbbc950d117ebaef7dcf"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"},{"locator":"section:8.4.9.2 不良事件|block:1136|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0f7f6cabfa781e","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a4dbbca5ee93dd8afdc70483dd7648214180490ccefcd4eceab6680c02415d81"},{"locator":"section:7.3.1 病例报告表的设计|block:1037|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"a081fa03f5ce0ceb2ca2444ea6b2a850997611938884f75fa4f6b5e188b3af68"},{"locator":"section:统计分析单位签字页|block:57|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"288c4151aa03e0bb0feffeb19ae4b67d399ea214ab90d8f02d3dd67800bdd070"},{"locator":"section:统计分析单位签字页|block:56|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"ce0d2dfe125632cc5d7e00e964022f9cd73382987f5a821bb4cc70694b086ad9"},{"locator":"section:研究目的和终点|block:321|chunk:1","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:6b9f50aa913504","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","text_sha256":"67acce9109ac9afcabc94dc949b010c17d925d27ae49d9aaf0c358c3c7d229e1"}]}